  <name>aTrain</name>
  <summary>
    Offline transcription of speech recordings, including speaker diarization, utilizing state-of-the-art machine learning models.</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      aTrain is a tool for automatically transcribing speech recordings utilizing state-of-the-art machine learning models without uploading any data. It was developed by researchers at the Business Analytics and Data Science-Center at the University of Graz and tested by researchers from the Know-Center Graz.
    </p>
    <p>
      Features include:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Automatic speech-to-text transcription</li>
      <li>Speaker diarization</li>
      <li>GPU acceleration with CUDA support</li>
      <li
            >Export transcriptions in various formats, including MAXQDA, ATLAS.ti and nVivo compatible output, </li>
      <li>Completely offline - all processing done locally</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
